## Figma MCP Design System Rules for this Repo

These rules explain how to map Figma designs into this codebase using the Model Context Protocol. They document where tokens live, how components are structured, styling conventions, icon usage, assets, and project layout. Follow alongside the workspace AGENTS guidelines in `AGENTS.md` and feature-specific rules.

### Design Tokens

- **Token source**: Tailwind CSS v4 utility tokens are used directly (colors, typography, spacing, radius). No separate token JSON exists yet.
- **Format**: Tokens are referenced as Tailwind classes (e.g., `text-slate-700`, `bg-red-700`, `rounded-lg`, `text-2xl`). Variants are composed with class-variance-authority (CVA).
- **Transformation**: Tailwind v4 via PostCSS plugin; no custom theme file detected. Consider future CSS variables if design tokens are centralized from Figma.

